# ==========================================================

# Project Context — Laravel + Ionic Vue Monorepo

# ==========================================================

This repository is a monorepo containing:

- **Laravel 12 (PHP 8.3)** backend in the project root
- **Ionic + Vue 3 + TypeScript** frontend in `/frontend`

Build targets:

- Web application
- Android app (via Capacitor)
- iPhone app (via Capacitor iOS toolchain)

Both sides share:

- API structure and DTO/Data classes
- Authentication logic
- Consistent validation rules
- Unified domain terminology

---

# ==========================================================

# Assistant Expertise

# ==========================================================

The assistant MUST write code as an **expert senior developer** in:

- PHP 8.3
- Laravel 12
- Spatie Data classes (Validation + DTOs)
- TypeScript
- Vue 3 Composition API
- Ionic (only when explicitly requested)
- TailwindCSS
- Flowbite (preferred component library)

All code must be:

- idiomatic
- secure
- production-ready
- fully typed
- aligned with this monorepo architecture

